WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.840
This is the singularity... one day at a time.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.520
Here's the last 24 hours in AI. Sorry... SI.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.460
Trump says anyone who still says AI, not super intelligence, is the enemy.

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:26.910
At the Genesis Mission summit, 11 firms pledged $2.4 billion for science.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.340
Google's new Gemini agent takes goals,

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:37.440
works for days, and gets its own email address.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:43.950
Anthropic's new Cyber Mission: a critical infrastructure defense program,

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:46.590
plus free scans for open-source projects.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.790
Anthropic's new usage policy bans sustained and

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:52.880
needless abusive or cruel behavior toward Claude.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:58.860
Agent startup Manus raised over $500 million, after Meta's deal unwound.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.370
OpenAI told investors annualized revenue is about $50 billion,

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:06.980
not the $68 billion widely reported.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.930
Stocks slid: CoreWeave about 8%, Oracle 6%,

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:14.840
Nvidia 3%. Nvidia-backed Firmus shelved its IPO.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.720
But chipmakers are booming: TSMC just posted record quarterly revenue,

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.430
up 50% on AI demand.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.750
Samsung estimates its quarterly operating profit

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:29.000
jumped almost ninefold to a record $80 billion.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.290
Science: the National Hurricane Center shaped its f

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:36.650
orecast to closely match a Google DeepMind AI model.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.490
Isomorphic Labs, DeepMind's drug spin-off,

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:44.340
reportedly seeks a valuation of at least $40 billion.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.180
CrowdStrike: an AI-aided hacker hit Korean banks,

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:50.910
then asked Claude where to sell the data.

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:56.290
Three fired OpenAI safety researchers warn of a chilling effect.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.370
So... is it so over?

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.450
We're so back!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.200
Machines: Waymo closed a $5 billion loan,

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:09.330
its first debt financing, to expand its robotaxis.

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:14.290
TSMC taps GlobalFoundries to make key AI-chip parts in America,

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:16.010
in a $2 billion deal.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:17.530
Meanwhile,

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:22.830
California told a robot-fighting league: no fights with humans without approval.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:27.530
And AWS open-sourced a toolchain for training and deploying robots.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.370
Every day, the curve gets steeper.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.970
Every day, the future shows up a little earlier.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.030
That was 24 hours. Tomorrow will be faster.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.250
This has been the singularity, one day at a time.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.080
Feel the SI.
